rk\\u003eastrolabe\\u003c/mark\\u003e on the chart table during\",\"snippet_tree\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Where does the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"astrolabe\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"searchHighlight\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" live between voyages? On the chart table In the captain's cabin Keep the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"astrolabe\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"searchHighlight\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" on the chart table during\"}]}]},\"rank\":0.0027322405185855802,\"href\":\"/issues/CORE-1/asks/b8e490d8-c809-464b-993d-f8ad1777ae71\",\"ask\":{\"state\":\"answered\",\"answer\":{\"user\":\"alice\",\"selected\":[\"On the chart table\"],\"text\":\"Keep the astrolabe on the chart table during every crossing, and recalibrate its rete against the meridian at local noon whenever the sky is clear enough to take a clean sighting. Log each reading beside the dead-reckoning position in the ship's book, note the observer and the instrument's serial number, and send any drift larger than half a degree to the instrument maker before the next voyage leaves port.\",\"at\":\"2026-11-22T18:21:58.189072Z\",\"text_tree\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Keep the astrolabe on the chart table during every crossing, and recalibrate its rete against the meridian at local noon whenever the sky is clear enough to take a clean sighting. Log each reading beside the dead-reckoning position in the ship's book, note the observer and the instrument's serial number, and send any drift larger than half a degree to the instrument maker before the next voyage leaves port.\"}]}]}}}},{\"kind\":\"comment\",\"owner\":{\"kind\":\"issue\",\"key\":\"CORE-2\",\"title\":\"Other work\",\"status\":\"triage\"},\"issue\":{\"key\":\"CORE-2\",\"title\":\"Other work\",\"status\":\"triage\"},\"id\":\"ca12f702-a1c4-4e34-be6b-03dd9828469a\",\"snippet\":\